<title>DUBAI: UAE 1995 trade surplus down at 16.86 bln dhs.</title>
<headline>UAE 1995 trade surplus down at 16.86 bln dhs.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Arab Emirates trade surplus edged down to 16.86 billion dirhams in 1995 from 17.24 billion in 1994, central bank figures show.</p>
<p>					1995		     1994</p>
<p> Trade balance		    16.86		    17.24</p>
<p> Total exports		    103.06		   100.53</p>
<p> Oil and gas exports	    50.09		    46.94</p>
<p> Other exports		    17.96		    18.49</p>
<p> Re-exports			 35.01		    35.10</p>
<p> Total imports		    86.20		    83.29</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures in billions of dirhams. The 1995 figures are preliminary. The 1994 figures are revised.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom, 9714-626990</p>
</text>
